JetBrainsMono-Regular.ttf is from JetBrains Mono
(https://github.com/JetBrains/JetBrainsMono), Copyright 2020 The JetBrains
Mono Project Authors. Licensed under the SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1:
https://openfontlicense.org

Used as the embedded egui_term typeface so Unicode punctuation (e.g. →)
shares the same cell advance as ASCII, avoiding cursor/glyph overlap.

---

term-symbols.ttf combines:

1. Braille Patterns (U+2800–U+28FF) subset of DejaVu Sans
   (https://dejavu-fonts.github.io/), Copyright Bitstream / DejaVu authors.
   Licensed under the Bitstream Vera / DejaVu fonts license — see
   https://dejavu-fonts.github.io/License.html
   Covers agent ink spinner frames on “Running … tok” rows.

2. ⌕ (U+2315) outline copied from Noto Sans Symbols
   (https://fonts.google.com/noto/specimen/Noto+Sans+Symbols), Copyright 2022
   The Noto Project Authors. SIL Open Font License 1.1:
   https://openfontlicense.org
   Covers agent “Find …” tool marker.

Rebuild: `scripts/rebuild-term-symbols-ttf.sh`
(needs `python3` + `fonttools`).
